imud-wmm-data (2025.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: WMM2025 coefficients (model epoch 2025.0, valid
    2025.0-2030.0), split out of the imud package so the data can be
    updated independently of the daemon. Installs to
    /usr/share/imud/WMM.COF; imud prefers an operator-supplied
    /etc/imud/WMM.COF when present.

